    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your bond with your wildfire spirit can save you from death. If the spirit is within 120 feet of you when you drop to 0 Hit Points and fall Unconscious, you can make the spirit drop to 0 Hit Points. You then regain half your Hit Points and immediately rise to your feet. Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
